  "chain": "legacy drawing nonconformance (1983) [cause B] -> UV relay power train mis-assigned (2019 mod) -> [in parallel: 480V breaker micrologic trip defect -> MCC 2B2 deenergized] -> both converge -> two DTT undervoltage relays deenergize to failed condition -> unexpected trip path -> automatic reactor trip on RPS Loss of Load -> AFAS-1 actuation on low SG level [backup: main feedwater available throughout]",
